{"id": "47528", "title": "602噬人公寓", "author": "无意归", "category": "恐怖灵异", "count": 58, "available": 12, "cover": "files/article/image/47/47528/47528s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/47/47528.htm", "intro": "一个陌生的网上约会，却将主人公苏阳卷入了一桩离奇的杀人案，于是围绕着死者被割去的头颅，以及神秘网友的命运，发生了一连串令人毛骨悚然的事件：半夜短信里的无头尸体照片，床头摸到的人头，尸水自楼上渗透下来滴落在头发上……最后真相大白，但一桩凶杀案了结，却让另外一桩凶杀案没有定论。于是问一句：那一个头颅哪里去了，也许就在与你约会的陌生网友的家里……", "base": "files/article/html/47/47528", "chapters": [{"title": "第一部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "一", "file": "6432477.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "6432478.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "6432479.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "6432480.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "6432481.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "6432482.html", "available": false}, {"title": "七", "file": "6432483.html", "available": false}, {"title": "八", "file": "6432484.html", "available": false}, {"title": "九", "file": "6432485.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十", "file": "6432486.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十一", "file": "6432487.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十二", "file": "6432488.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十三", "file": "6432489.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十四", "file": "6432490.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十五", "file": "6432491.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十六", "file": "6432492.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十七", "file": "6432493.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十八", "file": "6432494.html", "available": false}, {"title": "十九", "file": "6432495.html", "available": false}, {"title": "第二部分", "volume": true}, {"title": "一", "file": "6432497.html", "available": false}, {"title": "二", "file": "6432498.html", "available": false}, {"title": "三", "file": "6432499.html", "available": false}, {"title": "四", "file": "6432500.html", "available": false}, {"title": "五", "file": "6432501.html", "available": false}, {"title": "六", "file": "6432